### **File Naming Conventions**
- **Controllers:** `*.controller.ts` (e.g., `users.controller.ts`)
- **Services:** `*.service.ts` (e.g., `users.service.ts`)
- **Modules:** `*.module.ts` (e.g., `users.module.ts`)
